 ["h2", "yang-membantu", "Yang terbukti membantu, dan yang tidak", "What helps, and what does not"],
 ["p", "Untuk DOMS, tidak ada satu intervensi ajaib. Tinjauan literatur menunjukkan gerak aktif ringan memberi pereda sementara yang paling konsisten, sementara pijat dan kompresi memberi efek kecil hingga sedang [1][2]. Obat antiinflamasi mungkin meredakan nyeri, tetapi untuk cedera jaringan lunak, panduan PEACE & LOVE menyarankan menghindarinya di hari-hari awal tanpa saran tenaga medis [5].",
  "For DOMS there is no magic intervention. The literature shows light active movement gives the most consistent temporary relief, while massage and compression have small to moderate effects [1][2]. Anti-inflammatories may dull the pain, but for soft-tissue injury the PEACE & LOVE framework advises avoiding them in the early days unless a clinician recommends them [5]."],
